<title>USA: American Re Q1 net $29.9 mln vs $49.1 mln.</title>
<headline>American Re Q1 net $29.9 mln vs $49.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in millions)</p>
<p>					Three-month period ended</p>
<p>					     March 31,</p>
<p>					 1997	   1996     % Chg</p>
